  "prose": [
    {
      "title": "Input types",
      "text": "`input` class can be used for any input field type. Including `text`, `password`, `email`, `number`, `date`, `datetime-local`, `week`, `month`, `tel`, `url`, `search`, `time`\n\nFor `checkbox`, `radio`, `file`, `range` use their own class names, as they are not visually input fields.\n\nInputs can be used with `validator` class to have validation styles. [See Validator component](/components/validator/) for more details.",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
